WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.657
This is one page of a smart lock manual.

2
00:00:03.657 --> 00:00:05.788
Now, watch the same steps.

3
00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:08.332
Slide the latch into the door edge,

4
00:00:08.332 --> 00:00:10.817
with the up arrow on top.

5
00:00:10.817 --> 00:00:12.940
Fasten it with two screws.

6
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.275
Keep the bolt in.

7
00:00:14.925 --> 00:00:19.122
From the outside, pass the keypad cable under the latch.

8
00:00:19.122 --> 00:00:22.018
Then press the keypad flat against the door.

9
00:00:22.668 --> 00:00:25.949
Inside, pull the cable through the mounting plate.

10
00:00:25.949 --> 00:00:28.675
Two long screws go into the keypad.

11
00:00:28.675 --> 00:00:30.319
Keep both sides straight.

12
00:00:30.969 --> 00:00:33.961
Push the plug into the lock until it clicks.

13
00:00:33.961 --> 00:00:36.696
Tuck the cable away, so it is not pinched.

14
00:00:37.346 --> 00:00:39.567
Set the tailpiece horizontal.

15
00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:41.859
Guide it through the slot in the latch.

16
00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:43.885
Then press the unit onto the plate.

17
00:00:44.535 --> 00:00:46.853
Turn the thumb turn by hand.

18
00:00:46.853 --> 00:00:50.108
The bolt must move all the way, with no rubbing.

19
00:00:50.108 --> 00:00:52.317
Then add the batteries and the cover.

20
00:00:52.967 --> 00:00:54.610
Close the door.

21
00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.441
If the bolt hits the strike plate,

22
00:00:56.441 --> 00:00:59.458
move the plate until the bolt enters the middle of the hole.

23
00:01:00.558 --> 00:01:03.804
The bolt moves freely, and the lock just works.
